        "t": 605.8952840000002,
        "r": 429.33740399999994,
        "b": 597.023564928177
      },
      "content": "Check the connection of the cable. Also check for a broken wire."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1556",
      "reading_order": 2059,
      "section": "1-16.  Alarm AL-27",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.84,
        "t": 593.7203,
        "r": 500.1004979999999,
        "b": 579.0323
      },
      "content": "⇒ Connect the cable correctly. If any wire in the cable is broken, replace it."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1557",
      "reading_order": 2060,
      "section": "1-16.  Alarm AL-27",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.379628,
        "t": 554.8948760000001,
        "r": 396.4706520000007,
        "b": 546.023156928177
      },
      "content": "Position coder defective Check the position coder signal."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1558",
      "reading_order": 2061,
      "section": "1-16.  Alarm AL-27",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.84,
        "t": 542.7203,
        "r": 302.9219280000003,
        "b": 528.0323
      },
      "content": "⇒ Replace the position coder."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1559",
      "reading_order": 2062,
      "section": "1-16.  Alarm AL-27",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.379628,
        "t": 503.89487600000007,
        "r": 562.6613699999997,
        "b": 477.98314492817684
      },
      "content": "Feedback  signal  level  insufficient  (for  built  in  sensor  or  the  high  resolution  magnetic  pulse coder)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1560",
      "reading_order": 2063,
      "section": "1-16.  Alarm AL-27",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.83940599999997,
        "t": 469.87497200000007,
        "r": 379.6731240000007,
        "b": 461.00325292817683
      },
      "content": "Check the feedback signal level with an oscilloscope."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1561",
      "reading_order": 2064,
      "section": "1-16.  Alarm AL-27",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.84,
        "t": 457.76030000000003,
        "r": 469.71384599999925,
        "b": 443.07230000000004
      },
      "content": "⇒ Adjust so that the feedback signal level becomes the rated value."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
